OL,3,ADrag Race co-creator warns of TV
OL,4,Arepresentation 'crisis' after BBC drops
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe co-creator of Drag Race has said
OL,8,Fthere is a "crisis of representation"
OL,9,Fon TV, following the BBC's decision to
OL,10,Faxe the UK edition of the show.
OL,12,FSpeaking exclusively to BBC News,
OL,13,FFenton Bailey said he did not believe
OL,14,Fthere was a "hidden agenda" behind the
OL,15,Fdecision, but feared "vulnerable
OL,16,Fcommunities are going to be even more
OL,17,Fvulnerable".
OL,19,FThe move led viewers to raise concerns
OL,20,Fabout the corporation's on-screen
OL,21,Frepresentation, after it also cancelled
OL,22,Ftwo LGBTQ+ dating shows.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
