OL,3,ADrag Race co-creator warns of TV
OL,4,Arepresentation 'crisis' after BBC drops
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FA spokesperson for the BBC said the
OL,8,Fdecision was down to "significant
OL,9,Ffinancial pressures", as it attempts to
OL,10,Fmake #500m of savings.
